Wolves have a territorial
range of about 300 miles,

27:57.937 --> 27:59.521
and a kill range of 30.

28:03.610 --> 28:07.654
If we're close to their den,
and if we're within that radius,

28:07.739 --> 28:09.907
then they'll come after us.

28:13.828 --> 28:15.787
Well, how can we
tell if we're close?

28:17.123 --> 28:18.916
We can't.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.876
They might've
just been feeding.

28:20.960 --> 28:23.879
There's bodies everywhere. I
threatened them, they attacked.

28:23.963 --> 28:25.297
What about
the radius?

28:25.965 --> 28:28.967
I mean, if we're in that,
what? They're gonna fight us?

28:29.219 --> 28:31.094
I thought wolves
were scared of people.

28:31.179 --> 28:33.347
Not if we're
near their den.

28:33.431 --> 28:35.849
They're not scared
of anything then.

28:36.601 --> 28:37.601
What kind of
wolves are they?

28:37.685 --> 28:39.978
I mean, what do they call the
ones that just eat plants and shit?

28:40.313 --> 28:42.147
They don't
call them wolves.

28:42.232 --> 28:43.815
Herbivores,
that's what you mean.

28:43.942 --> 28:45.817
That's wishful thinking.

28:46.694 --> 28:49.655
When did you become king shit
fucking animal expert all of a sudden?

28:50.782 --> 28:54.493
They paid me to kill those things,
to keep them from killing you.

28:54.953 --> 28:57.037
So it makes sense for me
to know they're man-eaters

28:57.121 --> 29:00.582
and they don't give a shit
about berries and shrubs.

29:00.667 --> 29:03.669
There's blood in the air.
And there's death.

29:07.257 --> 29:09.383
They know we're wounded.

29:09.467 --> 29:11.176
They can smell it.

29:13.763 --> 29:16.765
Hopefully they
won't fuck with us.

29:19.769 --> 29:22.312
We need to move
these bodies out of here.

29:22.397 --> 29:25.023
And then we've
gotta find food.

29:35.034 --> 29:37.953
Check this
fucking thing out.

29:38.037 --> 29:39.621
Jesus, Diaz,
don't do that.

29:39.747 --> 29:41.331
No, man.

29:41.416 --> 29:45.294
I saw one of these once.
It's got a beacon, you know?

29:45.378 --> 29:47.296
Like a GPS.

29:47.380 --> 29:48.672
Yeah.

29:51.217 --> 29:52.634
Holy shit!

29:55.763 --> 29:58.640
Holy shit, man.
It works. It's beeping!

29:58.725 --> 30:01.059
This thing will reach up,
like, 40,000 feet!

30:01.144 --> 30:03.979
Yes, I think that's
great that that gives you hope.

30:04.063 --> 30:05.480
It's fucking
heartwarming.

30:05.606 --> 30:07.065
Very funny, bro.

30:08.192 --> 30:12.362
That's nice, my friend. That's
calfskin. It's very nice. Not cheap.

30:15.533 --> 30:18.160
Since you cocksuckers didn't
give us a holiday bonus,

30:18.244 --> 30:19.536
I'm gonna accept this
on behalf of my homies.

30:19.620 --> 30:21.121
Put that back.

30:23.166 --> 30:24.541
Put it back!

30:25.084 --> 30:27.544
We're not looting
dead bodies for swag.

30:27.628 --> 30:28.879
You got lucky
today, Ottway.

30:28.963 --> 30:30.630
You should be lying there
with them. Don't push it.

30:30.715 --> 30:31.757
I'm not gonna
say it again.

30:31.841 --> 30:33.425
Motherfucker,
take a big step back!

30:33.509 --> 30:36.762
I'm gonna start beating the shit
out of you in the next five seconds,

30:36.846 --> 30:41.099
and you're gonna swallow a lot
of blood for a fucking billfold.

30:54.113 --> 30:55.781
I can't fucking
stand guys like that.

30:55.865 --> 30:57.699
Hey, you're gonna just
turn that into charcoal, bro.

30:57.784 --> 30:58.784
No, I got it.

30:58.868 --> 31:00.786
By my account, I'd say
we have about enough booze

31:00.870 --> 31:02.537
for you guys to get
drunk two more times.

31:02.622 --> 31:03.663
Don't get weird.

31:03.748 --> 31:04.873
After that,
then we'll all be sober.

31:04.957 --> 31:06.708
Jack makes me fight.
Oh, yeah.

31:06.793 --> 31:08.168
Ladies, ladies!

31:08.252 --> 31:09.419
You like the white
or the brown?

31:09.504 --> 31:10.670
How about
some brown stuff?

31:10.755 --> 31:13.048
No tequila.
Sorry about that.

31:13.132 --> 31:14.383
It's all good.
Thanks, papa.

31:14.467 --> 31:15.842
Where the fuck
did you get that?

31:15.927 --> 31:18.929
In that thing, that
serving thing with wheels on it.

31:19.013 --> 31:20.472
Bunch of dead
bodies all over, man.

31:20.556 --> 31:23.183
You wanna make sure you know
where that meat came from.

31:23.267 --> 31:24.935
It's like that movie where they start

31:25.019 --> 31:27.562
taking chunks of frozen
ass out of that guy.

31:27.647 --> 31:28.855
The plane crash.

31:28.981 --> 31:30.357
That dude from Training Day? Right.

31:30.441 --> 31:32.567
That'd be fucking
funny as fuck.

31:32.652 --> 31:34.736
That was like
dead ass on a stick.

31:34.821 --> 31:36.988
Or you thought like a severed
dick was a hotdog, right?

31:37.073 --> 31:38.156
That's
too fucking funny.

31:39.826 --> 31:41.660
I wish some of the other
dudes would have lived.

31:47.542 --> 31:48.917
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

31:49.001 --> 31:50.585
You hear that?

31:50.670 --> 31:52.254
Get up! Get up!

31:53.673 --> 31:55.340
What is that?
Go, go, go!

31:55.425 --> 31:57.426
What the fuck is that?

31:57.885 --> 32:00.512
What is it?
What the fuck...

32:07.019 --> 32:08.812
Everybody be cool.

32:09.897 --> 32:11.189
Don't move.

32:16.362 --> 32:17.946
Jesus Christ!

32:18.030 --> 32:20.073
Stare right back
at them.

32:25.204 --> 32:28.123
Wait, wait, wait.
Why are they coming closer?

32:28.207 --> 32:29.749
Fuck this shit. I'm
getting back in the plane.

32:29.834 --> 32:32.836
Flannery, God damn it, don't move.

32:32.920 --> 32:35.672
Look at the size of
that fucking thing.

32:53.399 --> 32:55.734
We'll take...
We'll take two-hour shifts.

32:55.818 --> 32:58.069
I'll start.
You guys get some sleep.

32:58.154 --> 33:01.573
Yeah, like that
shit's gonna happen.

33:50.540 --> 33:51.998
Don't be afraid.

34:04.554 --> 34:05.887
Hey.

34:09.058 --> 34:11.309
Don't drift off on us, Burke.

34:12.061 --> 34:13.979
I'll be all right.

34:15.231 --> 34:17.232
I'm not going to sleep.

34:24.574 --> 34:26.324
Oh, you motherfucker.

34:31.998 --> 34:34.708
Where is my goddamn kid
when I need him?

34:38.879 --> 34:40.171
Fuck it.

34:51.601 --> 34:52.767
Fuck.

36:29.407 --> 36:31.157
Oh, Jesus, God.

36:32.576 --> 36:34.119
Hey. Hey!

36:39.750 --> 36:40.834
Oh, Jesus, God.

36:44.630 --> 36:45.880
No, no, no, no.

36:46.465 --> 36:47.590
Fuck!

36:48.008 --> 36:49.342
Hernandez!

36:50.094 --> 36:51.302
Shit!

36:57.560 --> 36:58.685
They ate him.

37:01.230 --> 37:03.064
Jesus Christ.
They ate him.

37:08.154 --> 37:10.113
They weren't
eating him.

37:11.699 --> 37:13.158
They were killing him.

37:15.828 --> 37:17.328
Fuck! Fuck! Fuck!

37:17.496 --> 37:19.497
How did we not hear him?

37:19.582 --> 37:20.915
How many did it
take to do that?

37:23.335 --> 37:28.339
We could dig in, make some kind
of a stand. Not much cover, though.

37:28.424 --> 37:30.008
Whoa, whoa,
what do you mean "stand"?

37:30.551 --> 37:33.386
Like, fight those motherfucking
giant things? You out of your mind?

37:33.471 --> 37:35.972
They'll get bold. And
start to come in for us.

37:36.348 --> 37:39.225
Why would they? I mean, we're not
harming them. It's not for food.

37:39.310 --> 37:42.479
We're a threat. We don't
belong here. That's it.

37:46.776 --> 37:49.277
There's trees out there.

37:49.779 --> 37:52.113
If we could get to that tree
line, they might back off.

37:52.198 --> 37:54.032
If they see that we're
leaving, they might.

37:54.116 --> 37:57.285
Fuck that! What they might do, bullshit.

37:57.369 --> 38:00.246
What they might do? Are
you fucking kidding me?

38:00.331 --> 38:02.582
Hey. They pissed
all over this place.

38:02.666 --> 38:05.752
They mean to tag it. We can't
wait them out, we'll starve.

38:06.378 --> 38:08.213
There's a lot of bad space
between us and that forest,

38:08.297 --> 38:11.549
but if we get
there, then...

38:11.634 --> 38:14.469
We can better
defend ourselves.

38:14.553 --> 38:15.887
Less exposed,
I don't know.

38:15.971 --> 38:18.515
Yeah, you don't know.

38:18.599 --> 38:21.559
And nobody nominated
you shit, by the way.

38:22.478 --> 38:24.187
It's getting to that
point in the evening, girls.

38:24.563 --> 38:25.688
Fucking to
each his own.

38:25.773 --> 38:27.482
What the fuck you talking
about. Diaz? Come on, man.

38:27.566 --> 38:29.192
You wouldn't last five
fucking minutes out here.

38:29.276 --> 38:32.487
I survived that.
This ain't shit.

38:32.571 --> 38:34.572
I'd find a way through,
with or without you.

38:34.657 --> 38:38.993
Fuck it. I'm gonna take whatever I
can carry and head into those trees.

38:39.078 --> 38:41.287
If you guys wanna join me,
I'd strip everything.

38:47.086 --> 38:51.047
Fuck. All right,
let's fucking do this.

40:05.122 --> 40:06.164
Hey.

40:08.375 --> 40:10.668
We should collect
all the wallets

40:11.337 --> 40:13.087
for the families.

40:17.176 --> 40:20.762
Wallets? Did I hear wallets?
I'll carry the wallets.

40:24.391 --> 40:26.559
Henrick?

40:26.644 --> 40:27.977
Do you mind carrying them?

40:28.062 --> 40:29.520
Yeah, let's waste
a little more time.

40:30.397 --> 40:32.565
Even though the weather's
about to kick our ass.

40:33.817 --> 40:35.818
You grab them wallets.

40:37.071 --> 40:38.947
Fucking idiots.

40:40.741 --> 40:42.408
To Hernandez.

40:45.913 --> 40:48.122
Grab as many
as you can.

40:48.999 --> 40:50.583
Grab as many
as you can.

40:50.960 --> 40:52.794
Waste as much
fucking time as you can.

40:53.504 --> 40:55.797
I'm gonna sit here with
my friend, Jack Daniel's,

40:55.881 --> 40:58.257
and waste some time
of my own.

41:00.803 --> 41:02.887
Why don't you just
fucking help us, man?

41:02.972 --> 41:05.431
I'm helping you. I'm helping
you. I'm warming up, man.

41:05.516 --> 41:07.934
You guys find any rubbers,
save them.

41:08.018 --> 41:09.936
I don't know how long I'm gonna
be out here with you fairies.

41:10.020 --> 41:11.646
Why don't you
shut the fuck up?

41:16.944 --> 41:20.405
Key to survival, fellas,
getting them wallets.

41:20.906 --> 41:22.407
Getting them wallets.

42:00.779 --> 42:01.904
Henrick.

42:23.135 --> 42:24.260
Wait.

42:31.060 --> 42:32.727
I feel like we
should say something.

42:32.811 --> 42:34.771
I mean, all these bodies,
all these...

42:35.230 --> 42:39.817
All these people that died, it
doesn't seem right to just walk away.

42:50.287 --> 42:53.748
I don't know any
official prayers, so, I guess...

42:56.960 --> 43:01.339
God bless these men.
They were,

43:02.925 --> 43:08.679
some of them, our friends, and
we could be lying here with them.

43:13.685 --> 43:17.021
So thank you for sparing
us and helping us.

43:21.026 --> 43:23.694
Oh, and keep that up
if you can.

44:51.241 --> 44:54.160
Fuck!

44:54.953 --> 44:56.787
Fuck!

45:02.211 --> 45:04.337
Don't worry about me,
motherfuckers!

45:04.421 --> 45:08.049
You know, you wanna run off
into the trees, that's cool, too!

45:10.135 --> 45:12.637
No, no, no, no. Ottway!

45:13.764 --> 45:16.140
Help me! Help me!

45:17.476 --> 45:18.476
Help me!

45:18.810 --> 45:21.729
Fuck! Flannery!

45:22.147 --> 45:23.481
Get off him!

45:23.815 --> 45:25.149
Flannery!

45:28.570 --> 45:30.154
Flannery!

45:30.239 --> 45:31.572
Get away from him!

45:32.991 --> 45:34.242
Jesus.

45:34.326 --> 45:36.327
Flannery! Flannery!

45:39.081 --> 45:40.581
Get off him!

46:14.199 --> 46:15.491
No.

46:54.197 --> 46:56.407
Do you wanna say anything?

47:03.040 --> 47:07.209
Come on, let's keep moving. There's
nothing else we can do for him.

47:20.891 --> 47:23.809
Those trees aren't
getting any fucking closer.

47:23.894 --> 47:26.312
We're gonna be out here
in the dark with those things.

47:26.438 --> 47:28.022
We have no idea
if we're going toward

47:28.106 --> 47:29.690
the den or away
from it, do we?

47:29.775 --> 47:32.026
Why didn't we just
stay with the plane?

47:32.110 --> 47:34.195
Come on. They
would have surrounded us.

47:34.279 --> 47:37.406
How the fuck do we know
they're not doing that right now?

47:37.783 --> 47:39.408
Fucking genius.

47:40.243 --> 47:42.286
We're still
better off in the trees.

47:42.371 --> 47:46.499
Yeah, we're better off.
Go tell that kid, you fuck.

48:06.311 --> 48:07.812
Hey, what is that?

48:12.317 --> 48:13.401
Run!

48:13.527 --> 48:14.610
Go! Go!
Get into the trees!

48:14.694 --> 48:15.736
Mother of Christ!

48:19.741 --> 48:20.908
Go, go, go!

48:20.992 --> 48:22.326
Jesus,
they're right on us!

48:22.411 --> 48:24.078
Don't stop moving!

48:25.247 --> 48:27.289
Wait, wait,
wait! Wait!

48:31.211 --> 48:33.546
Don't look back!
Run! Run!

48:34.339 --> 48:36.173
They're flanking us!

48:37.259 --> 48:38.634
Don't stop!

48:47.727 --> 48:49.603
You see them?
You see them?

48:49.688 --> 48:52.273
They're all around us.

48:52.357 --> 48:54.775
We need a fire to
keep them off us. Hurry!

48:56.945 --> 48:59.029
The wood's wet.
Whole thing's wet.

48:59.239 --> 49:00.489
Hurry, hurry!

49:04.035 --> 49:05.703
Get that
fucking thing lit.

49:09.916 --> 49:11.792
- Come on!
- Come on, baby, come on.

49:11.877 --> 49:13.919
Tell me that
thing's not broke.

49:14.963 --> 49:15.963
Damn this thing.

49:16.047 --> 49:17.214
Just
get it going, Ottway.

49:17.299 --> 49:18.632
Light! Light!

49:19.718 --> 49:21.719
That's it,
that's it.

49:24.222 --> 49:26.140
It's going out.
Fuck!

49:32.731 --> 49:33.981
Jesus, come on!

49:34.065 --> 49:35.357
Smother...
Don't smother it.

49:55.754 --> 49:57.087
It worked.

49:57.923 --> 49:59.590
We should start
perimeter fires.

49:59.674 --> 50:01.550
Let's see these bastards
before they come for us.

50:26.785 --> 50:28.869
What the fuck
was that?

50:29.496 --> 50:31.830
The alpha. They went at him.

50:34.042 --> 50:35.292
He put it down.

50:36.336 --> 50:40.256
Whatever that challenge was,
the alpha put it down.

50:43.134 --> 50:44.552
How are we gonna
deal with this?

50:45.637 --> 50:47.179
We kill them,

50:48.473 --> 50:49.682
one at a time.

50:50.225 --> 50:53.644
Tip the numbers. That's
what they're doing to us.

51:11.371 --> 51:12.913
What the hell are these for?

51:12.998 --> 51:14.290
I'll explain.

51:14.374 --> 51:16.250
Friction tape,
electrical tape.

51:16.334 --> 51:17.751
Talget, you had
some, yeah?

51:17.836 --> 51:18.919
It's in there somewhere.

51:19.004 --> 51:20.546
Shotgun shell.

51:22.424 --> 51:23.757
Spear tip.

51:25.176 --> 51:27.970
The tip has to drive into the
primer to set off the shell.

51:28.805 --> 51:30.598
Secure them
with these sticks,

51:30.682 --> 51:32.266
a little bit of
tape, simple.

51:34.352 --> 51:36.770
You jab with it when
the wolf gets close.

51:36.855 --> 51:40.524
Hit them hard.
Let it get real close.

51:42.402 --> 51:43.777
It'll work.

51:44.362 --> 51:46.447
It's like a bang stick.

51:46.531 --> 51:49.408
The round discharges,
you pull it loose,

51:50.410 --> 51:53.662
you still got something
sharp to create distance.

51:54.289 --> 51:56.290
Unless you wanna
fist fight them.

51:56.750 --> 51:58.500
There you go.

51:59.461 --> 52:02.713
One shot a piece, guys.
Make them count. Burke.

52:06.051 --> 52:07.718
Blacken the tips
in the fire, guys.

52:08.053 --> 52:09.720
It makes them harder,
stronger.

52:12.057 --> 52:13.724
Really, boys?

52:14.643 --> 52:16.727
This is what it's
come down to, huh?

52:16.811 --> 52:18.646
This MacGyver bullshit?

52:22.108 --> 52:23.233
Okay.

52:24.319 --> 52:25.569
Good.

52:28.239 --> 52:31.450
I appreciate a good laugh
as much as the next guy.

52:43.004 --> 52:45.047
These things,
they see well at night?

52:45.131 --> 52:48.258
Jesus, can we talk about
something else, please?

52:48.593 --> 52:51.929
Talget, you're carrying all
that booze. Let's break it out.

52:52.013 --> 52:53.889
I recommend
rationing what we have.

52:53.973 --> 52:56.183
I recommend you
kissing my ass.

52:56.267 --> 52:58.644
What are you,
the booze police now?

52:58.728 --> 53:01.605
You fucking guys with your rules
and your orders and bullshit.

53:03.066 --> 53:04.400
Where are we?

53:04.818 --> 53:06.443
Look around.

53:07.112 --> 53:11.448
This is Fucked City,
population five and dwindling.

53:16.496 --> 53:20.207
Two days, three maybe, if we
really pull our shit together.

53:21.292 --> 53:24.753
And who's in charge of that
right now? This fucking guy?

53:25.964 --> 53:27.798
The Great White hunter?

53:30.677 --> 53:33.971
And his jerry-rigged
fucking wolf sticks?

53:35.849 --> 53:38.809
Why are you constantly breaking
balls and bitching about everything?

53:38.893 --> 53:41.937
'Cause I wanna live,
motherfucker. You understand that?

53:42.021 --> 53:44.732
I don't want some timber wolf
shitting me out on this mountain.

53:46.025 --> 53:47.025
You're scared.

53:48.987 --> 53:50.154
What?

53:50.238 --> 53:54.241
You don't need all that nonsense,
all that chest-puff bullshit.

53:54.325 --> 53:55.534
What's wrong
with being scared?

53:56.828 --> 53:58.412
I'm not scared.

53:58.997 --> 54:00.664
You're not?
No.

54:02.000 --> 54:03.250
I'm terrified.

54:03.376 --> 54:04.585
I can tell.

54:04.669 --> 54:06.587
And not an ounce of
shame in saying it.

54:07.005 --> 54:08.922
I'm scared shitless.

54:09.007 --> 54:11.341
That's because
you're a punk.

54:13.511 --> 54:15.804
I don't walk through this
world with fear in my heart.

54:15.889 --> 54:18.223
You picked that up
in the pen?

54:18.308 --> 54:21.185
Somebody scribble that
on the day room wall?

54:22.353 --> 54:24.521
You better take it easy,
motherfucker.

54:25.648 --> 54:29.359
Talking tough means jack
shit now. You're not scared?

54:30.028 --> 54:33.280
You're a fool.
Worse, you're a fucking liar.

54:33.364 --> 54:35.657
I should have checked your
chin at the fucking plane.

54:35.742 --> 54:37.993
Get up, come on,
get up, you big Irish fuck.

54:38.119 --> 54:40.120
You wanna knuckle up... Hey,
Diaz, put the fucking knife away.

54:40.205 --> 54:41.538
We don't have time for this.
Get the fuck off me!

54:41.623 --> 54:43.040
Hey, Diaz, put
the knife away. Shut up!

54:43.124 --> 54:44.541
Shut up, you chickenshits make me sick.

54:45.794 --> 54:47.002
Son of a bitch!

54:47.086 --> 54:48.295
You got that kid
Flannery killed

54:48.379 --> 54:49.671
and you're not
gonna get me killed.

54:49.756 --> 54:51.673
Put your fucking hands up. Let
me show you how this is done.

54:51.758 --> 54:53.217
Put your fucking hands up.

54:54.636 --> 54:57.471
Fuck! You motherfucker!

54:57.555 --> 55:01.475
You cut this shit out.
Do you hear me?

55:28.962 --> 55:31.171
Get up,
get up, get up.

56:19.596 --> 56:21.221
What the fuck?

56:21.931 --> 56:23.473
What did it want?

56:24.142 --> 56:25.434
You.

56:45.872 --> 56:48.332
Diaz, please don't do
that shit to me again.

56:49.751 --> 56:51.168
All right?

57:03.514 --> 57:04.806
No mas.

